VimStorm app icons (app/assets/icons/)
======================================

Every SVG here is either an IntelliJ Platform icon from IntelliJ IDEA Community Edition (section 1)
or VimStorm's own drawing (section 2). None comes from a closed-source JetBrains product or plugin.
The file name -> icon mapping is in src/kit/icons/table.rs (completion/ and the symbol list:
src/editor/floats/kinds.rs, src/search/symbol_icons.rs).

JetBrains, IntelliJ IDEA and WebStorm are trademarks of JetBrains s.r.o.; VimStorm is not made or
endorsed by JetBrains.


